        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://www.w3id.org/MQTT4SSN-Ontology#ControlPacket"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An MQTT Control Packet sent by the Server to acknowledge a SUBSCRIBE request and indicate the assigned subscription options or failure codes.</rdfs:comment>
